1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,231
Look at the name to the left of the slash at the top.

2
00:00:04,231 --> 00:00:07,025
It identifies the repository owner.

3
00:00:07,025 --> 00:00:12,454
Opening the instructor material does not create your own
repository.

4
00:00:12,454 --> 00:00:16,206
If you already own ai-learning, continue there.

5
00:00:16,206 --> 00:00:18,282
Pause and check the owner.

6
00:00:18,282 --> 00:00:21,282
Pause here and check your own screen.

7
00:00:21,282 --> 00:00:27,200
GitHub is a separate account from your university page or
Google account.

8
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:29,389
Keep your existing account.

9
00:00:29,389 --> 00:00:33,605
New users sign up and follow the verification email.

10
00:00:33,605 --> 00:00:37,659
Open Profile and note the username in its address.

11
00:00:37,659 --> 00:00:41,145
Enter passwords and sign-in codes yourself.

12
00:00:41,145 --> 00:00:43,253
Pause to finish this step.

13
00:00:43,253 --> 00:00:46,253
Pause here and check your own screen.

14
00:00:46,253 --> 00:00:48,974
Open the course student template.

15
00:00:48,974 --> 00:00:53,510
Choose Use this template, then Create a new repository.

16
00:00:53,510 --> 00:00:58,541
A star or a browser bookmark does not create your
repository.

17
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:03,076
If the button is missing, check that you are signed in.

18
00:01:03,076 --> 00:01:07,530
Skip creation if you already have your own repository.

19
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:09,509
Pause before continuing.

20
00:01:09,509 --> 00:01:12,509
Pause here and check your own screen.

21
00:01:12,509 --> 00:01:18,582
Choose your own account as Owner, enter ai-learning, and
select Private.

22
00:01:18,582 --> 00:01:25,076
Use Create repository from template, or the equivalent
creation button shown.

23
00:01:25,076 --> 00:01:30,390
The image contains example values; do not copy github or
hello.

24
00:01:30,390 --> 00:01:35,282
After creation, check your username and the Private label.

25
00:01:35,282 --> 00:01:36,210
Pause here.

26
00:01:36,210 --> 00:01:39,210
Pause here and check your own screen.

27
00:01:39,210 --> 00:01:44,552
Open Code in your own ai-learning and find setup and the
week folders.

28
00:01:44,552 --> 00:01:49,742
If they are missing, ask your instructor before recreating
anything.

29
00:01:49,742 --> 00:01:51,497
Preserve existing work.

30
00:01:51,497 --> 00:01:59,205
The repository address is used for initial registration,
which is separate from invitation and weekly

31
00:01:59,205 --> 00:02:00,045
submission.

32
00:02:00,045 --> 00:02:02,716
Pause and bookmark your repository.

33
00:02:02,716 --> 00:02:05,716
Pause here and check your own screen.
